From 7da456c065adbe96a3f984f31ae21db2571c085d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Scott Hanan (t2 executor)" <t3exec@t2.tailc9b568.ts.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:18:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/15] fix(server): requeue unsent starts on restart only
 under the hub hold (#303)

Without a hold, restart keeps upstream's meaning and cancels in-flight runs,
so upstream queue-order behaviour is unchanged. Recovery mocks answer the new
outbox read; migration manifest tests include 063.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
